  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="6.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIAtr">II Atr</ref> 6.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Æt eallum slyht ⁊ æt ealre ðære hergunge ⁊ æt eallum ðam hearmum ðe ær ðam gedon wære, ær ðæt frið geset wære, man eall onweig læte, ⁊ nan man þæt ne rece ne bote ne bidde.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">As regards all the slaughter and all the harrying and all the injuries which were done before the truce was made—all of them shall be forgotten, and no-one shall avenge them or demand compensation for them.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">De omni homicidio et omni robaria et omnibus incendiis, que facta sunt antequam pax fuerat instituta, totum dimittatur, et nemo uindictam uel emendationem exigat.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
